  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "Draft: Edit Resolved Name: Always display manual entries",
  "description": "Wireshark allows you to define custom names for source/destination addresses, by: selecting an IP packet, right click, \"Edit Resolved Name\", and then selecting a custom name.\n\nBefore, Wireshark defaulted \"Resolve network (IP) addresses\" to disabled (which is good). But, if you used the \"Edit Resolved Name\" feature, your custom name would not show up, unless you set \"Resolve network (IP) addresses\" to enabled. This is confusing for users.\n\nWith this change, flag each custom name that was set by the user as a special manual entry type. Then, always display the user's custom entry.",
