        {
          "id": 914469758,
          "type": null,
          "body": "I can't see any real downsides to this approach. The only thing that *may* make sense to change, is change \"Edit Resolved Name\" to something like \"Set custom hostname\". If this is merged, and people like the new wording better, I can also change that in a separate merge request.\n\n\"Edit Resolved Name\" wasn't 100% accurate before either. eg: You could edit/set an (unresolved) IP address, not just \"Resolved\" things.",
